      "releaseNotes": "Thanks for choosing Voice Recorder! This update focuses on making your recording experience smoother and more reliable.\n\n- Added compatibility with iOS 27.\n- Play your recordings alongside audio from other apps, such as YouTube.\n- Fixed issues with uploading recordings to Dropbox.\n- Fixed bugs in the audio converter.\n\nWe’re always listening! If you have feedback or need a hand, reach out to us through our support channels. Happy Recording!",
